{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Xeno's Adventure is a run and gun action game with focus on boss fights and harder difficulty. You will explore different worlds, battle mind controlled monsters and bosses, all in a drawn 2D Pixel Art style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Xeno as you traverse different worlds, upgrade your stats, learn powerful skills, while you try to save all worlds from the antagonist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Xeno's Adventure includes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Worlds to explore</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 Platformer Levels\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >14 Bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Shops (Unlock Skills, Upgrade Skills &amp; Upgrade your Character's Stats)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 60 different monsters (4 different types of enemies for example &quot;Range Attack Enemy&quot;)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depending on the skill of the player, it will take you 6 to 14 hours of playtime, to finish the game.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Some Change","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3895000/ec61ccdae22aa05ae438c8c44d61c459f91e0af1.jpg"},{"name":"Filthy Rich!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3895000/d6afe9c13f94c30cd4f2afb3294bc7676745f5e7.jpg"},{"name":"The Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3895000/805c9ec9ea752a8dc753f3e111753310e6b35abc.jpg"},{"name":"First Steps","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3895000/600523ae1e20f1e0730b8af32129ef0f1bd8efd1.jpg"},{"name":"Some Bars","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3895000/417a49fd87ed7b877e